  "decision_conditions": [
    "<p>The Development hereby permitted shall only be carried out and completed strictly in accordance with the submitted plans hereby approved and any subsequent approval of details.\r\n</p><p><br></p><p>\r\nREASON: To ensure that the development hereby permitted is carried out in full accordance with the plans hereby approved.\r\n</p>",
    "<p>The development hereby permitted must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of this permission.</p><p><br></p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\nREASON: In order to comply with the provisions of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).</p><p>\r\n</p>",
    "&lt;p&gt;All new works and works of making good to the retained fabric shall be finished to match existing with regard to the methods used and the materials, colour, texture, profile and finish, unless otherwise specified on the approved plans.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Reason: In the interests of preserving and enhancing the special architectural and historic interest of the building and the character and appearance of the De Beauvoir Conservation Area, in accordance with Section 72 of the Planning (Listed Buildings and Conservation Areas) Act 1990, London Plan Policy HC1, and Hackney Local Plan Policies LP1 and LP3.&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
